title: RAITG - Requirement-Aware Intelligent Test Generator
message: If you use this dataset or pipeline, please cite the paper and this Zenodo deposit.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Vijay Prasad
    family-names: Javvadi
    email: vijay@vijayjavvadiresearch.ai
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0004-1192-6906'
    affiliation: Independent Researcher, Plainsboro, NJ, USA
version: 2.0.0
date-released: '2026-06-17'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/javvadivijayprasad/TestCaseGen_Reserach'
url: 'https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20285104'
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility bundle for RAITG, a 4-stage LLM-based pipeline that
  generates test cases from natural-language requirements. Version 2.0.0
  includes 362 requirements across 4 domains (commercial web, financial
  services, healthcare, last-mile delivery logistics), 4 reference
  applications, full pipeline source code, and all artifacts needed to
  reproduce the empirical evaluation reported in the companion paper.
